			"name": "Intimidation",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Boy's size and temper do most of the work; the skill just channels it.\n\nDesign: Will+1 (9) for 4 points, Average. GURPS Intimidation (B202) lets ST substitute for Will on the roll itself, which matters far more for an Ork than the raw skill level does.",
